+For headless runs, `--model` overrides `VAULTLENS_LLM_MODEL`, saved provider `models`, local
+`profiles`, and tracked mappings, in that order. Explicit `--model ""` selects native defaults.
+`--effort` overrides the canonical role effort for either provider. Scheduled jobs retain
+explicit effort overrides and freeze resolved role models for each batch. Plain interactive
+sessions retain their native/global model selection.
+
+**Interactive subagent runs ignore headless flags.** Generated adapters are configuration
+snapshots of per-provider settings, excluding launch-scoped environment overrides. Regenerate
+after changing role metadata or provider mappings: `python3 tools/agents/generate-adapters.py`.
+A concrete adapter model/effort overrides the parent session; empty model mappings inherit its
+model. Some models may reject a role's effort level; adjust the role or explicitly override
+headless effort when selecting such a model. The CLI reports unsupported combinations.
+
